:320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1751978/c7c36259-fb1d-49eb-9cdc-446972b7339a.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1751978/c7c36259-fb1d-49eb-9cdc-446972b7339a.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Welcome to your new home in Bergkirchen-Lauterbach, near Munich!\n\nLooking for a comfortable, fully furnished house in a peaceful residential area near Dachau and Munich?\n\nDiscover your own private home in Bergkirchen-Lauterbach, thoughtfully furnished to make your arrival simple and comfortable.\n\nLocated in a quiet residential neighborhood northwest of Munich, this spacious semi-detached house combines privacy, comfortable living areas and a beautiful private garden with practical connections to Dachau and the greater Munich region.\n\nWhether you’re relocating for work, moving with your family or planning an extended professional stay, you’ll find a welcoming place to settle in and feel at home.\n\nYOUR PRIVATE HOUSE\n\nEnjoy the comfort and independence of having an entire furnished house to yourself.\n\nThe property features:\n\n* 4 bedrooms with flexible sleeping arrangements\n* 6 beds in total, including single and double beds\n* A spacious living area with comfortable seating\n* A wood-burning stove for a cozy atmosphere\n* A dining area with seating for up to 6 people\n* A dedicated workspace\n* Wardrobes and storage space\n* Heating and WiFi access\n* Television\n* A private garden and terrace\n* A bright, welcoming interior suitable for extended stays\n\nThe main bedroom includes two single beds that can be positioned together when required.\n\nAdditional bedrooms provide flexible sleeping arrangements, making the property particularly suitable for professionals, families and project teams.\n\nThe lower level also offers additional space that can be used for sleeping or relaxing.\n\nOne of the highlights of the house is its private outdoor area. Enjoy your morning coffee on the terrace, relax in the garden after work or spend time outdoors with family and friends.\n\nDesigned for both relaxation and everyday living, the house provides a comfortable environment to work, unwind and enjoy your own routine.\n\nKITCHEN & BATHROOM\n\nMake yourself at home with practical facilities designed for everyday living.\n\nYour private kitchen includes:\n\n* A fully equipped separate kitchen\n* Induction cooktop\n* Oven\n* Microwave\n* Refrigerator\n* Dishwasher\n* Extractor hood\n* Practical storage and preparation space\n\nThe kitchen is suitable for preparing everyday meals and enjoying independent living throughout your stay.\n\nBathroom facilities:\n\n* 1 main private bathroom\n* Bathtub\n* Spacious shower with glass enclosure\n* Two washbasins\n* Separate guest toilet\n* Private washing machine\n* Private tumble dryer\n\nThe additional guest toilet and private laundry facilities provide extra convenience, especially for families and residents sharing the house.\n\nEverything is arranged to make your daily routine comfortable, whether you’re preparing breakfast before work or enjoying a relaxed evening at home.\n\nLOCATION & CONNECTIONS\n\nLocated in Bergkirchen-Lauterbach, the property offers peaceful residential surroundings with convenient access to Dachau and the wider Munich region.\n\nThe neighborhood is particularly attractive for residents who appreciate privacy, outdoor space and a quieter living environment away from the busy city center.\n\nGetting around:\n\n* Regional MVV bus services connect Lauterbach with surrounding communities, including Dachau.\n* Dachau provides S-Bahn and regional train connections toward Munich.\n* Munich city center can be reached via the transport connections from Dachau.\n* A car is strongly recommended for convenient everyday commuting and maximum flexibility.\n\nAround the neighborhood:\n\n* Dachau offers supermarkets, shopping facilities, restaurants and everyday services.\n* The surrounding area provides countryside, green spaces and opportunities for walking and cycling.\n* Dachau’s town center offers cafés, restaurants and additional shopping options.\n* Munich and its surrounding business districts are accessible for work and professional appointments.\n\nThe location is especially suitable for professionals working in Dachau, western or northern Munich, and nearby business locations.\n\nWhether you’re commuting, exploring Bavaria or enjoying a peaceful day at home, Bergkirchen-Lauterbach provides a comfortable base for your stay.\n\nLIVING WITH mHOMES\n\nA new home should feel welcoming from the moment you arrive.\n\nWith over 10 years of experience in furnished housing in Munich and the surrounding region, mHomes offers professionally managed accommodation and friendly, multilingual support.\n\nOur local team is here to assist you with move-in information, everyday questions and maintenance coordination whenever needed.\n\nWe take care of the practical details so you can focus on enjoying your new home.\n\nRENTAL DETAILS\n\n* Entire private furnished semi-detached house\n* 4 bedrooms\n* Suitable for up to 4 residents\n* Private garden and terrace\n* Fully equipped kitchen\n* Main bathroom and separate guest WC\n* Private washing machine and tumble dryer\n* WiFi available\n* Dedicated workspace\n* Minimum rental period: Please refer to the booking conditions\n* Non-smoking property\n* Pets are not permitted\n* A car is recommended\n* Monthly rent and deposit: As displayed in the listing\n\nApartment dimensions, if displayed, are approximate unless independently verified. Please contact us if exact measurements are important to your booking decision.\n\nMAKE YOURSELF AT HOME\n\nExplore the photos attached to this listing to discover your future home.\n\nWith its four bedrooms, comfortable living areas, private terrace and garden, this property is an excellent option for anyone seeking a furnished home for an extended stay near Dachau and Munich.\n\nHave questions about the property, neighborhood or your move-in?\n\nSend us a message directly through HousingAnywhere. Our team will be happy to help!\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you.\n\nYour mHomes Team\n\nYour space. Your city. Your home.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"4"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"250"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":330000,"deposit":660000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"3300.00","deposit":"6600.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":15,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-13T00:13:43Z","__utId__":"ut1751978"}]